{"id":"aa9cb1cb7b132eb4","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-aronszajn.md","title":"Existence of an Aronszajn Tree","display":"thm-aronszajn — Existence of an Aronszajn Tree","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-aronszajn","aliases":["58-thm-aronszajn"],"display":"thm-aronszajn — Existence of an Aronszajn Tree","depends_on":["[[58-df-tree-property]]","[[58-df-omega1]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-aronszajn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-aronszajn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-aronszajn — Existence of an Aronszajn Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"58-df-tree-property\">58-df-tree-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"58-df-omega1\">58-df-omega1</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>（首个不可数序数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"58-df-omega1\">58-df-omega1</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-树谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"58-df-tree-property\">58-df-tree-property</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\\)</span>（余终分支谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"58-df-tree-property\">58-df-tree-property</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}aronszajn}\\vdash \\exists T,R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\omega_1)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\omega_1)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}aronszajn}\\vdash \\exists T,R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\omega_1)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\omega_1)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>满足断言的对象是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-Aronszajn 树：高度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>、每层可数且没有余终分支。</li>\n<li>ZFC 证明这种树存在，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 不具有树性质。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-tree-property","status":"resolved","id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega1","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega1]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega1","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega_1$（首个不可数序数，见 [[58-df-omega1]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree-property","status":"resolved","id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S$（$\\kappa$-树谓词，见 [[58-df-tree-property]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree-property","status":"resolved","id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S$（余终分支谓词，见 [[58-df-tree-property]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}aronszajn}\\vdash \\exists T,R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\omega_1)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\omega_1)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":931,"backlinks":[{"id":"059acbe8570b41df","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"This is the exact $\\omega_1$-tree/canonical-cofinal-branch signature used by [[58-thm-aronszajn]]; no local height or level primitives are introduced."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4031","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-aronszajn.md|58-thm-aronszajn]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["e72a83d57cf9c8fb","27ae6ad867a7007d"]}